(
    title: "Blodia",
    description: Some("A sliding-tile pipe puzzle: each board is a grid of pipe pieces with one empty black square, and a ball starts rolling through the pipes. You slide pieces into the gap to keep laying track ahead of the ball and carry it to the goal, because a dead end or a blank square drops it. Two can play, and an edit mode lets you build your own boards."),
